  "description": {
   "en": "Alicia has been fighting against the demon king's army and protecting the kingdom as the saintess. However, one day, she is framed by her fiancé, the prince, and his affair partner, and she is sentenced to be publicly executed. Disparaged by the people of the kingdom and plunged into despair by the malice of the people, Alicia makes a final wish.\n\n\"I'll kill you all\"\n\"And destroy this country\"\nShe wishes for the death of everyone.\n\nAlicia was supposed to have died, but she realizes, she was brought back to life by the demon king.\n\"Haha, now I can kill them all.\"\n\nThe curtain rises on the vengeance of the saintess who has been revived from execution...!\n\nWeb Novel Raw Link - https://ncode.syosetu.com/n1179he/"
  },
